## 📚 Références Scientifiques

1. Goldwasser, S., Micali, S., Rackoff, C. — *The Knowledge Complexity of Interactive Proof Systems*.
2. Pedersen, T. P. — *Non-Interactive and Information-Theoretic Secure Verifiable Secret Sharing*.
3. Cramer, R., Damgård, I., Schoenmakers, B. — *Proofs of Partial Knowledge and Simplified Design of Witness Hiding Protocols*.
4. Schnorr, C. P. — *Efficient Signature Generation by Smart Cards*.
5. Fiat, A., Shamir, A. — *How to Prove Yourself: Practical Solutions to Identification and Signature Problems*.
6. Bünz, B. et al. — *Bulletproofs: Short Proofs for Confidential Transactions and More*.

